# Eval results: commit only summary.json (the cache fingerprints), usage.json
# (the token counts the export prices) and classification.json (which says a
# failure was the model's, so it is not rerun) so a new contributor reuses the
# memoization cache; ignore the heavy transcripts/outputs.
